  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NoteReader
  prompt: Read maintenance order
  title: Maintenance Order No. 12
  body: 'Drive assembly must be re-seated after every cleaning.


    Seat the drive
    gears from smallest to greatest, peg I to peg III. A gear out of place will jam
    the whole works.


    Spare gears are kept around the room. Somebody keeps leaving
    them on the floor.'
